327	     * {@code normalizedTelephone + '|' + lowerEmail + '|' + soundex(lastName)} (an absent email
328	     * contributes an empty segment). Two owners are the same person — a hard duplicate — exactly
329	     * when their identity keys match; owners who merely share a household (same last name and
330	     * postcode) but differ in telephone, email or surname sound derive distinct keys. The telephone
331	     * and email are expected to already be in their normalized storage form.
332	     */
333	    @Transient
