406	    /**
407	     * Return this owner's tenure in whole fiscal years: the number of fiscal years elapsed from the
408	     * {@link #getRegistrationDate() registration date} to today, i.e. the count of 1 July
409	     * fiscal-year boundaries crossed. A newly created owner registered in the current fiscal year
410	     * has zero tenure. Zero when no registration date is known.
